{"product":{"id":7604227211322,"title":"Burundi Mikuba 8","body_html":"\u003ch6\u003eCoffee overview\u003c\/h6\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMikuba 8 is a late-season pickup from Long Miles Coffee Project, who we last worked with in 2018 (!). Two very dynamic lots came in from LMCP, and Mikuba is the jucier and jammier of the two. Expect an expressive, fruit-forward cup with nice sweetness and clarity.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch6\u003eCoffee flavor profile\u003c\/h6\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRed grape, raspberry, hibiscus\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAcidity: tartaric, red\/blue fruits\u003cbr\u003eSweetness: jammy\u003cbr\u003eBody: clean, tea-like\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch6\u003eBrewing evaluation\u003c\/h6\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRest: 40+ days recommended\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFilter eval day 1: \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=UcHf9hvEwlM\" title=\"Gabi Standard Recipe for filter coffee video on Youtube\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eGabi Standard Recipe\u003c\/a\u003e of 1:18 shows a very light roast, with signs of extended rest needed. The initially jammy presentation of fruits is more juicy here on day 1. Nice hibiscus in the finish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe use 60 hardness, 20 buffer water heated to 198F in all of our recipes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch6\u003eInformation\u003c\/h6\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStation: Mikuba\u003cbr\u003eProducer: \u003cspan\u003emultiple smallholder farmers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegion: Kayanza\u003cbr\u003eCountry: Burundi\u003cbr\u003eVariety: Red Bourbon\u003cbr\u003eProcess: Washed\u003cbr\u003eSourcing: Long Miles Coffee Project via Osito\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"H+S Coffee Roasters","product_type":"Coffee","created_at":"2026-09-06T08:42:44-06:00","handle":"burundi-mikuba-8","updated_at":"2026-09-25T04:28:10-06:00","published_at":"2026-09-06T08:59:45-06:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"global","tags":"_badge_new, africa, Burundi, coffee, Kayanza, Red Bourbon, Single Origin, washed","variants":[{"id":41634028879930,"product_id":7604227211322,"title":"125g (4.4oz)","price":"21.00","sku":"718-125g","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"125g (4.4oz)","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-06T08:42:44-06:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T04:28:10-06:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":135,"image_id":null,"weight":135.0,"weight_unit":"g","inventory_quantity":24,"old_inventory_quantity":24,"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":41634028912698,"product_id":7604227211322,"title":"250g (8.8oz)","price":"36.00","sku":"718-250g","position":2,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"250g (8.8oz)","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-06T08:42:44-06:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T04:28:10-06:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":260,"image_id":null,"weight":260.0,"weight_unit":"g","inventory_quantity":24,"old_inventory_quantity":24,"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":41634030682170,"product_id":7604227211322,"title":"1kg (2.2lb)","price":"114.00","sku":"718-1kg","position":3,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"1kg (2.2lb)","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-06T08:51:35-06:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T04:28:10-06:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":1010,"image_id":null,"weight":1010.0,"weight_unit":"g","inventory_quantity":4,"old_inventory_quantity":4,"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_curren